Perubahan TVL atau volume sebelum vs sesudah: TVL Ronin Jan 2023 ~$50-100M (post-bear), naik ke ~$150M mid-2023 lalu turun lagi【Phase 8 Adoption Metrics】(HIGH) [DefiLlama Ronin, https://defillama.com/chain/Ronin]; Volume Katana DEX Jan 2023 ~$10-30M, peak mid-2023 lalu turun【Phase 8 Liquidity】(HIGH) [DefiLlama Katana, https://defillama.com/dex/katana]
